      "text": "4. Do not route condensate or any wet service directly above a rack or a sleeve entering above one.\nSee M-302 for the roof-condenser line-set path.",
      "originalText": "4. Do not route condensate or any wet service directly above a rack or a sleeve entering above one. See M-302 for the roof-condenser line-set path.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 46,
      "versionNonce": 1874606747,
      "index": "b2Y",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e222",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1130,
      "y": 919,
      "width": 695.2902656856312,
      "height": 30,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786319785044,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5. Fill percentages: NEC Chapter 9 Table 1 - 53% for one cable, 31% for two, 40% for three or\nmore. The two-cable case is the tightest; sizing off the 40% habit under-sizes it.",
      "originalText": "5. Fill percentages: NEC Chapter 9 Table 1 - 53% for one cable, 31% for two, 40% for three or more. The two-cable case is the tightest; sizing off the 40% habit under-sizes it.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 67,
      "versionNonce": 623808661,
      "index": "b2Z",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e223",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1130,
      "y": 963,
      "width": 703.2255915635563,
      "height": 30,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786319785044,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "6. Jam ratio (conduit ID / cable OD) of 2.8-3.2 with three same-size cables can wedge and stop the\npull dead. Size deliberately around that band, not into it.",
      "originalText": "6. Jam ratio (conduit ID / cable OD) of 2.8-3.2 with three same-size cables can wedge and stop the pull dead. Size deliberately around that band, not into it.",
